hived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:27:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:12Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/audio/effects/audio_effect_compressor.cpp:54-63`, the sidechain buffer is obtained via `thread_get_channel_mix_buffer()` which can return `nullptr` (via `ERR_FAIL_INDEX_V`), but the result is dereferenced without a null check:\n\n```cpp\nif (base->sidechain != StringName() && current_channel != -1) {\n    int bus = AudioServer::get_singleton()->thread_find_bus_index(base->sidechain);\n    if (bus >= 0) {\n        src = AudioServer::get_singleton()->thread_get_channel_mix_buffer(bus, current_channel);\n        // src CAN BE nullptr if current_channel is out of range!\n    }\n}\n\nfor (int i = 0; i < p_frame_count; i++) {\n    AudioFrame s = src[i];  // CRASH if src is nullptr\n```\n\n`current_channel` is set during `_update_bus_effects()` on the main thread, but this code runs on the audio thread. If the bus channel count changes between updates, `current_channel` can exceed the valid range.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set up an AudioEffectCompressor with a sidechain bus.\n2. Change the speaker mode or channel count of the sidechain bus while the compressor is active.\n3. Crash in the audio thread.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — null pointer dereference visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118456/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}